    {
      "turn": 16,
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "text": "Toto jumped out of Dorothy’s arms and hid under the bed, and the girl started to get him. Aunt Em, badly frightened, threw open the trap door in the floor and climbed down the ladder into the small, dark hole. Dorothy caught Toto at last and started to follow her aunt. When she was halfway across the room there came a great shriek from the wind, and the house shook so hard that she lost her footing and sat down suddenly upon the floor.",
      "source_span_characters": [
        3496,
        3935
      ],
      "audio": "units/turn-016.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0303858dfbeec3305affd5f791d94e1a74c8a4d59083abf62f410478bcb7cbff",
